name phfnote
category Package
revision 60733
shortdesc Basic formatting for short documents
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides basic formatting for short documents such
longdesc as notes on a specific topic, short documentation, or quick
longdesc memos. It aims to cover all basic needs for such purposes:
longdesc include a standard set of relevant packages, a nice title which
longdesc doesn't take up too much space, better page margin sizes, and
longdesc some basic styling to make the note look nicer. At the same
longdesc time, it is highly flexible and customizable.
